{"text": "One morning. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The busy doctor called Sue. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Into the hall. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She has one chance in ten. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He said. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And that chance is for her to want to live. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> She has made up her mind. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> That she is not going to get well. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> After the doctor left. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Sue went into Johnsys room. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> With her drawing board. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Whistling a cheerful tune. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Johnsy was lying. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> With her eyes wide open. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Counting backward. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Twelve, she said. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And a little later, eleven. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And then ten and nine. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Sue looked out of the window. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And saw only an old ivy vine. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Climbing up the brick wall. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Leaves on the ivy. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Johnsy whispered. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> When the last one falls. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I must go too. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I have known that for three days. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Oh, I never heard of such nonsense. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Said Sue. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But Johnsy only closed her eyes.", "alignment": {"characters": ["O", "n", "e", " ", "m", "o", "r", "n", "i", "n", "g", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "T", "h", "e", " ", "b", "u", "s", "y", " ", "d", "o", "c", "t", "o", "r", " ", "c", "a", "l", "l", "e", "d", " ", "S", "u", "e", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "I", "n", "t", "o", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "h", "a", "l", "l", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".",